= A Vacancy on the Court

Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg has died six weeks before the presidential election, and the question of who will fill her seat will shape the Court for a generation.

[? if dem_president = 0 and dem_senate = 0 : The Republican Senate says it will move quickly. ?][? if dem_president = 1 or dem_senate = 1 : We have the tools to shape the outcome. ?]

- @rbg_fight: Make the vacancy the campaign issue
- @rbg_norms: Appeal to the Senate's precedent

@rbg_fight
on-arrival: {!
Q.dem_enthusiasm = Math.min(10, Q.dem_enthusiasm + 1);
if (!Q.dem_president && !Q.dem_senate) { Q.court_lean += 1.5; }
if (Q.dem_president || Q.dem_senate) { Q.court_lean -= 0.5; }
Q.polarization += 1; Q.progressive_dissent -= 2;
!}

The fight dominates the final weeks.

@rbg_norms
